<title>UK: Trinkhaus &amp; Burkhardt sets warrants on the Dax.</title>
<headline>Trinkhaus &amp; Burkhardt sets warrants on the Dax.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt said on Monday it had issued 160 million American-style call and put warrants, in 16 equal tranches, on the Dax index.</p>
<p>There are various maturity dates. The warrants will be listed on the Duesseldorf, Frankfurt and Stuttgart exchanges. The pay date is January 23, 1997. 100 warrants control one index.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
